  "description": "Fursan White is a soft and elegant fragrance that blends creamy florals with sweet vanilla and smooth musky warmth. The scent feels clean, luxurious, and comforting while maintaining a refined modern character that works beautifully for everyday wear. The opening introduces bergamot and jasmine, creating a fresh floral brightness with a smooth feminine softness. The heart develops into white flowers and creamy accords, adding elegant floral depth balanced by warm sweetness and airy smoothness. The base settles into vanilla, musk, amber, and sandalwood, leaving a creamy, warm, and long-lasting trail that feels soft, cozy, and sophisticated. Fursan White is perfect for those who enjoy creamy floral fragrances with vanilla sweetness and a clean musky dry-down.",
